<p>
Father,
</p>

<p>
There are days<br>
when it seems<br>
like I&rsquo;m creating<br>
a minefield with<br>
carefully placed<br>
hazards of<br>
discord,<br>
ugliness,<br>
and lies.
</p>

<p>
Help me instead<br>
to plant seeds of<br>
truth,<br>
beauty,<br>
and peace;<br>
building a place<br>
where others can<br>
run without care —<br>
</p>

<p>
Barefoot,<br>
with joy,<br>
in the fields<br>
of the Lord.
</p>


